    description: "Build out a maintained doc enumerating the typing axes in the codebase (with examples and the canonical query each answers). The first axis landed in PR #3459 — Edge.type carries axis annotations (relationship / endpoint_shape / pending_classification) per ADR-0023 in packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/edge_types.py and surfaces under x-axis-of-values in docs/schema.json. Other implicit axes likely exist (Symbol.kind, supply_chain.tier, confidence_band, evidence_type). Deliverable: docs/concept-axes.md (or similar) cataloguing known axes; a script or generate-schema extension that auto-generates the catalog from x-axis-of-values keys across schema.json so the doc never goes stale; a process for declaring a new axis (extends ADR-0023's pattern). Substrate for the axis-declaration ADR template (sibling item) and the per-release audit cadence (sibling item)."  # 630b
