  message: "Substantially fulfilled by PR #3463: docs/concept-axes.md is auto-generated by scripts/generate-concept-axes from the canonical EDGE_TYPES registry, with a pre-commit freshness gate (matches the schema-freshness pattern). The 'never goes stale by hand' goal is satisfied because the doc cannot diverge from the registry without the pre-commit hook failing. Sibling items remain open: WI-surih-nogis (axis-declaration ADR template) for the creation practice; WI-gusam-faful (per-release axis audit cadence) for the maintenance loop. Both will reference docs/concept-axes.md as the authoritative axis catalog."  # c5ca
